SUMMARY:[Federal Maine-Related] Determination of Overfishing or an Overfis
 hed Condition
DESCRIPTION:This action serves as a notice that NMFS has found that Easter
 n Gulf of Maine Atlantic cod\, Western Gulf of Maine Atlantic cod\, George
 s Bank Atlantic cod\, and Southern New England Atlantic cod are overfished
 \; and Western Gulf of Maine Atlantic cod and Southern New England Atlanti
 c cod are also subject to overfishing.\nhttps://www.federalregister.gov/do
 cuments/2026/11/16/2026-23248/determination-of-overfishing-or-an-overfishe
 d-condition
URL:https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/11/16/2026-23248/determ
 ination-of-overfishing-or-an-overfished-condition
